{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>תבוס</b> — [verses 7–8] <b>תרמוס</b>." "<b>ונפש</b> — that is hungry: everything bitter is sweet to it. Therefore, just as a bird that wanders from its nest seeks its sustenance elsewhere, so a man who wanders from his place seeks his sustenance and will be satisfied."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:59.957773538Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}